# The Rust toolchain the rust package installs in the guest: the official
# musl build of the nightly rust-toolchain.toml pins (the one the myos std
# sysroot is built with: rlibs load only in the rustc that made them), from
# static.rust-lang.org, fetched at run time by `rust setup`, never shipped.
# toolchain/std/bump-nightly.sh --write rewrites this file with the channel.
# The sha256s are the channel manifest's (channel-rust-nightly.toml of that
# date), per host arch: RUST_<COMPONENT>_<arch>.
RUST_NIGHTLY=2026-07-26
RUST_RUSTC_x86_64=61684965055ac2c9660ef117e25fd54b7b7d08dc1da065e6de6bbffc1408bd05
